daemonarchy-pkg is the graphical package manager of Daemonarchy. It lists,
searches, installs, updates and removes packages from the repositories pkg is
configured with, shows each repository's signature state, and shows the plan
(what changes, how many bytes, from which repository) before anything runs.
What runs is exactly the plan that was shown: a small helper started as root
recomputes the plan and refuses if it changed. Downloads use several pkg
processes at once, and progress is measured, with estimates labelled.
